proteus (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * v1.0.0 — first stable, non-beta release. 18-subcommand CLI ergonomics
    wave: version/about, logs, state info, backup/restore, pin list,
    unpin --all/--scope, rotate --json / --reason, apply/revert --json,
    config show --annotate, config explain, persona search/delete,
    persona random --use, events list-sources/status/trigger, wiki list.
  * Hardening: V11 OUI catalogue extension (Espressif + Realtek);
    S3 state-lock mode(0o600) regression test pinned.
  * No breaking changes vs 0.4.3-beta. Semver commitment: the CLI surface,
    on-disk state schema, config schema, exit codes, and --yes gate
    semantics are now stable. Breaking changes will bump the major
    version (2.0.0+).

